296
00:07:55,850 --> 00:07:57,430
No drive, no copay.

297
00:07:57,780 --> 00:07:59,400
They say twenty minutes.

298
00:07:59,530 --> 00:08:00,860
I did thirty,

299
00:08:00,860 --> 00:08:01,770
twice a day,

300
00:08:01,770 --> 00:08:03,570
lowest setting that first
week.

301
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:05,210
I put it on the calendar.

302
00:08:05,320 --> 00:08:06,480
The first week,

303
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:07,320
I couldn't have told

304
00:08:07,320 --> 00:08:08,710
