332
00:08:48,350 --> 00:08:50,040
It comes down to four
steps.

333
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:50,710
One.

334
00:08:50,930 --> 00:08:52,290
The tissue around a new

335
00:08:52,290 --> 00:08:54,250
