over.

337
00:08:56,780 --> 00:08:57,420
Two.

338
00:08:57,460 --> 00:09:00,130
Inflamed tissue holds
extra fluid,

339
00:09:00,130 --> 00:09:01,130
so it takes up more

340
00:09:01,130 --> 00:09:02,180
