341
00:09:02,220 --> 00:09:02,980
Three.

342
00:09:03,270 --> 00:09:04,620
There's only so much room
in there.

343
00:09:04,660 --> 00:09:06,160
Bending compresses it.

344
00:09:06,350 --> 00:09:08,000
Straightening pulls it
tight.

345
00:09:08,170 --> 00:09:09,480
That's the squeeze.

346
00:09:09,520 --> 00:09:10,150
Four.

347
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:12,760
Red and near-infrared
light

348
00:09:12,760 --> 00:09:15,410
have been studied for
calming that inflammation,

349
00:09:15,410 --> 00:09:16,680
so the swelling and the
pressure

350
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:17,920
can come down with it.

351
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:19,360
In a randomized trial,

352
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:21,100
patients given light
therapy after

353
00:09:21,100 --> 00:09:22,250
