354
00:09:22,250 --> 00:09:24,620
had less pain, less
swelling

355
00:09:24,620 --> 00:09:26,180
and better early movement

356
00:09:26,180 --> 00:09:27,410
than those who weren't.

357
00:09:28,010 --> 00:09:31,340
A 2025 review said the
same,

358
00:09:31,340 --> 00:09:32,530
and was clear the evidence

359
00:09:32,530 --> 00:09:33,550
