362
00:09:37,190 --> 00:09:38,920
But after two years of
doing everything

363
00:09:38,920 --> 00:09:40,780
I was told and getting
nowhere,

364
00:09:40,780 --> 00:09:41,980
you have no idea what it's

365
00:09:41,980 --> 00:09:43,290
