night,

366
00:09:43,290 --> 00:09:44,770
say yes to the walk,

367
00:09:44,770 --> 00:09:46,230
and get my life back.

368
00:09:46,420 --> 00:09:47,730
So take it from me.

369
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:49,610
Don't spend another year
waiting

370
00:09:49,610 --> 00:09:50,710
